{center}{arialbld}Desert Fox{arial}

{arialbld}Situation: {arial}Tekton tanks have invaded Jaffar, cutting off Jaffari oil supplies from the Suze canal.

{arialbld}Jaffar:{arial} Desert climate.  The Jaffari sands are very rich in oil. A monarchy, the Sheikh Youssef Al Khadin is a calm and measured sovereign but also a skilled negotiator, who obtained financial and technical help from the Normo government for creating the {arialbld}Suze canal{arial}, which provides maritime access to the oil fields. 

{arialbld}Tektonia:{arial} A military dictatorship imposed by the Archduke {arialbld}Magnus Von Tekton{arial} in the wake of three years of economic chaos, which led to the downfall of the last {arialbld}Psycho emperor.{arial} The new Tekton regime found the key to a highly effective "war machine" at a very advanced level.  

{arialbld}Magnus Von Tekton:{arial} Tyrant megalomaniac, very dangerous. He came to power by assassinating his opponents one after the other. His wife the Archduchess Karola provided him with three sons : {arialbld}Otton, Tankred and Karlo{arial}. Word has it that they were given a completely military education from the youngest age which deprived them of any humanity. Now adults, they are the generals Magnus appointed to lead his army. Otton commands the land troops, Tankred the navy, and Karlo the air force. 

{arialbld}Mission:{arial} Jaffar constitutes our primary source of oil. Your mission is to liberate Jaffar from Tekton occupation and retake control over the Suze canal.
{}
